{"generated_at":"2026-09-11T04:36:09.436407Z","scope":"week","paper_count":35,"topics":[{"name":"Dust and ISM","count":10},{"name":"Galaxy Evolution","count":10},{"name":"Other Selected Research","count":10},{"name":"Strong Gravitational Lensing","count":7},{"name":"Multi-phase and Molecular Gas","count":6},{"name":"High-redshift Galaxy Dynamics","count":2}],"papers":[{"id":"2609.08649","canonical_id":"2609.08649","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"$\\texttt{LensFactory.jl}$: A general-purpose strong lens modeling package","authors":["Ashish Kumar Meena"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO"],"summary":"本论文介绍了LensFactory.jl，一个基于Julia编写的高效、开源、通用强引力透镜建模包，支持单平面和多平面透镜，利用Julia的多重分派实现模块化设计，并通过原生多线程加速计算密集型步骤，可在桌面级机器上数小时内完成星系团尺度的透镜重建。","date":"2026-09-09","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.08649","score":95,"stars":5,"tier":"must-read","mandatory":true,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55},{"label":"gravitational lens modelling","points":28}],"must_read_reason":"strong gravitational lensing","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing"]},{"id":"2609.07863","canonical_id":"2609.07863","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"A pilot submillimeter search for IceCube neutrino counterparts: JCMT follow-up and dusty-galaxy catalog associations","authors":["Yuji Urata","Kuiyun Huang"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA","astro-ph.HE"],"summary":"本文报告了一项亚毫米波段的先导搜索，将JCMT/SCUBA-2对IceCube中微子事件的后随观测与亮高红移尘埃星系目录匹配相结合。在51个历史事件中，4个视场含HerBS源（p=4.18e-3），其中Shadow Blaster被ALMA解析为一个z=2.988的强引力透镜尘埃恒星形成星系。该结果为分层搜索策略提供了支持性证据。","date":"2026-09-09","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.07863","score":92,"stars":5,"tier":"must-read","mandatory":true,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55},{"label":"dusty high-redshift galaxies","points":14},{"label":"neutrino physics","points":-45},{"label":"strong lensing + high-z dynamics","points":45},{"label":"high-z galaxy gas","points":20}],"must_read_reason":"strong gravitational lensing","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing","Multi-phase and Molecular Gas","Dust and ISM","Galaxy Evolution"]},{"id":"2609.07840","canonical_id":"2609.07840","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Observation-driven simulations of strong lensing galaxy clusters","authors":["L. Leuzzi","M. Meneghetti","A. Adam","L. Moscardini","C. Giocoli","P. Bergamini","Y. Hezaveh","M. Maturi","A. Mercurio","A. Moretti","Andrés A. Plazas Malagón","P. Rosati"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO"],"summary":"本文介绍了一个用于模拟星系团尺度强引力透镜的新代码，生成了100幅模拟星系团图像。该代码的创新之处在于利用经验关系建模星系团成员星系的性质，并引入了MPI并行范式和基于分数的扩散模型来增强背景源图像，使模拟更高效、更真实。","date":"2026-09-09","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.07840","score":92,"stars":5,"tier":"must-read","mandatory":true,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55}],"must_read_reason":"strong gravitational lensing","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing"]},{"id":"2609.07851","canonical_id":"2609.07851","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"LEGGOS: Direct abundances of N, O, Ne, S, and Ar in five lensed galaxies at Cosmic Noon","authors":["Brian Welch","Gourav Khullar","Taylor A. Hutchison","Keren Sharon","Pedram Abedi","Matthew B. Bayliss","Michael Florian","Dylan Berry","Jacqueline Antwi-Danso","Nikko J. Cleri","Håkon Dahle","Aleena Ebey Panzer","Michael D. Gladders","Rion Oh","Cole Panzer","Jane R. Rigby","T. Emil Rivera-Thorsen"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"本研究利用JWST/NIRSpec的LEGGOS巡天数据，对5个强引力透镜星系（z≈2.5-3.6）进行了直接电子温度（T_e）化学丰度测量，获得了N、O、S、Ar（以及部分Ne）的气相丰度，发现氧丰度范围约22%-126%太阳丰度，元素丰度比整体与局部和早期星系趋势一致。","date":"2026-09-09","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.07851","score":95,"stars":5,"tier":"recommended","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing"]},{"id":"2609.03089","canonical_id":"2609.03089","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"TDCOSMO XXIX: JWST/NIRSpec IFU Spatially Resolved Kinematics of Three Time-delay Lenses","authors":["Shawn Knabel","Pritom Mozumdar","Anowar J. Shajib","Tommaso Treu","Devon M. Williams","Michele Cappellari","David Law","Simon Birrer","Takahiro Morishita","William Sheu","Massimo Stiavelli"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO","astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"该论文利用JWST-NIRSpec积分场光谱提取了三个四重透镜类星体系统（HE0435-1223、PG1115+080、WFI2033-4723）中偏转星系的二维空间分辨恒星运动学，其平均每bin总不确定度为6-11%，相邻bin间相关性误差仅约1.2%。与之前TDCOSMO分析相比，孔径积分速度弥散在统计上一致（均在0.9σ内），平均不确定度从3.7%降至2.4%。研究将PG1115+080归类为快速旋转星系，另两个为慢速旋转星系，并为即将发布的TDCOSMO 2026宇宙学参数测量提供关键数据。","date":"2026-09-04","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.03089","score":95,"stars":5,"tier":"recommended","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55},{"label":"high-redshift galaxy dynamics","points":34}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing","High-redshift Galaxy Dynamics"]},{"id":"2609.09411","canonical_id":"2609.09411","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"TDCOSMO XXX: Spatially resolved kinematics of the deflectors in time-delay lens systems B1608+656 and SDSSJ1206+4332 from JWST-NIRSpec observation","authors":["Pritom Mozumdar","Shawn Knabel","Anowar J. Shajib","Tommaso Treu","Michele Cappellari","Aymeric Galan"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA","astro-ph.CO","astro-ph.IM"],"summary":"利用JWST NIRSpec积分视场光谱测量两个时间延迟透镜系统中偏折星系的恒星运动学，首次给出伴星系的光谱红移与速度弥散，并评估其引力扰动，为后续宇宙学参数测量提供数据。","date":"2026-09-10","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.09411","score":88,"stars":5,"tier":"recommended","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"high-redshift galaxy dynamics","points":34}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["High-redshift Galaxy Dynamics"]},{"id":"2609.08573","canonical_id":"2609.08573","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Harnessing stellar kinematics to constrain dark energy with the double-source-plane gravitational lens SDSS J0946+1006","authors":["Daniel J. Ballard","Wolfgang J. R. Enzi","Thomas E. Collett","Coleman M. Krawczyk","Giovanni Granata","Tian Li","Geraint F. Lewis","Karl Glazebrook","Huimin Qu"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO"],"summary":"本文利用引力透镜系统SDSS J0946+1006的多平面透镜建模，结合HST成像和VLT-MUSE速度色散测量，约束暗能量状态方程参数，得到与Planck和Pantheon数据一致的w值（约-1），并在w0-wa平面提供有价值的互补约束。","date":"2026-09-09","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.08573","score":85,"stars":4,"tier":"recommended","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55},{"label":"gravitational lens modelling","points":28},{"label":"pure cosmology","points":-30}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing"]},{"id":"2609.07850","canonical_id":"2609.07850","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"LEGGOS: A Shocking Lack of Evidence for Shocks at sub-kiloparsec Scales at 2 < z < 4","authors":["Nikko J. Cleri","Taylor A. Hutchison","Brian Welch","Gourav Khullar","Matthew B. Bayliss","Håkon Dahle","Michael Florian","Michael D. Gladders","Connor Luettgenau","Rion Oh","Jane R. Rigby","T. Emil Rivera-Thorsen","Julissa Sarmiento","Keren Sharon"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"该论文首次利用JWST/NIRSpec积分场光谱对6个引力透镜星系（2.37<z<3.625）进行系统性激波搜索，通过多种发射线诊断和MAPPINGS V激波模型，发现这些星系在像素、团块和星系尺度上均无明显激波证据。","date":"2026-09-09","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.07850","score":78,"stars":4,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Galaxy Evolution"]},{"id":"2609.07824","canonical_id":"2609.07824","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"The MICADO first light imager for the ELT: Simulated Observations of Star Forming Clumps at Cosmic Noon","authors":["Matteo Simioni","Carmelo Arcidiacono","Andrea Grazian","Marco Gullieuszik","Elisa Portaluri","Alvio Renzini","Benedetta Vulcani","Anita Zanella","Francesca Annibali","Michele Cirasuolo","Richard Davies","Natascha Förster Schreiber","Johanna Hartke","Hanindyo Kuncarayakti","Matteo Messa","Stefan Raffetseder","Letizia Scaloni","Elena Valenti","Eros Vanzella","Joël Vernet","Roland Wagner"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA","astro-ph.IM"],"summary":"本文评估了ELT首光成像仪MICADO在非透镜z=2星系中表征恒星形成团块（clumps）的能力。通过模拟观测，MICADO在最优条件下可探测到M_UV~-15的暗弱团块，结构分辨率可达R_e~20 pc，其约1平方角分的视场支持高效巡天，填补了宇宙正午时期团块形成与演化的观测空白。","date":"2026-09-09","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.07824","score":78,"stars":4,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Galaxy Evolution"]},{"id":"2609.11652","canonical_id":"2609.11652","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"TDCOSMO XXXI: New techniques in line-of-sight studies of time delay lenses","authors":["Daniel Johnson","Devon Williams","Chris Fassnacht","Patrick Wells","Pierre Fleury","Allan Schweinfurth","Martin Millon","Aymeric Galan"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO"],"summary":"本文将加权数计数技术标准化并升级（引入 Euclid Flagship 模拟、将视线积分拆分为观测者—透镜—源三段），对 TDCOSMO 2026 的 11 个时延透镜样本重新估计外部收敛 $κ_\\mathrm{ext}$，发现多数系统结果对方法变化敏感但一致性良好，中位值由 $-0.002$ 变为 $-0.006$。","date":"2026-09-11","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.11652","score":74,"stars":4,"tier":"recommended","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing"]}],"must_read":[{"id":"2609.08649","canonical_id":"2609.08649","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"$\\texttt{LensFactory.jl}$: A general-purpose strong lens modeling package","authors":["Ashish Kumar Meena"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO"],"summary":"本论文介绍了LensFactory.jl，一个基于Julia编写的高效、开源、通用强引力透镜建模包，支持单平面和多平面透镜，利用Julia的多重分派实现模块化设计，并通过原生多线程加速计算密集型步骤，可在桌面级机器上数小时内完成星系团尺度的透镜重建。","date":"2026-09-09","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.08649","score":95,"stars":5,"tier":"must-read","mandatory":true,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55},{"label":"gravitational lens modelling","points":28}],"must_read_reason":"strong gravitational lensing","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing"]},{"id":"2609.07863","canonical_id":"2609.07863","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"A pilot submillimeter search for IceCube neutrino counterparts: JC